00:00:05.069 --> 00:00:09.110
Well somewhere banking authorities are showing
belief in the potential of cryptocurrency

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.589
and somewhere else, cryptocurrency seems to
be losing it’s only stability, it’s peg

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:15.589
again and again.

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:21.710
Hello everyone and welcome back to coinmonks,
this is Shambhavi with you again for another

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.289
fresh dose to new updates.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:28.689
Starting up with the headlines,
Kazakhstan’s Central Bank Chairman Believes

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:34.290
in the Potential of Cryptocurrency
Stablecoins Loses Peg Yet Again

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:38.050
Prudential Insurance is all set to Plan a
Crypto Push

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:43.610
UK to Test Blockchain Technology in Traditional
Market Activities.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:49.840
Starting up,The National Bank of Kazakhstan’s
Chairman, Galymzhan Pirmatov, says that it

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:55.280
aims to extract the profit from technologies
the cryptocurrency market could provide.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.060
He made the statements during a press conference
on June 7.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:04.220
The Chairman, who stated that the bank is
eager to explore the possibilities and potential

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:09.189
of crypto, says,” I don’t think that the
National Bank is a latecomer.

00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:15.130
Like many other banks and financial regulators
across the globe, we’re watching closely

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.850
and researching the question(crypto potential).”

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:20.310
Kazakhstan’s Central Bank Chairman Believes
in the Potential of Cryptocurrency

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:24.290
While emphasising that Kazakhstan’s central
bank wants to extract the maximum profit from

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:29.710
the innovative potential crypto offers, Primatov
pointed out that it is too early to speak

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.240
about crypto legalisation.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:36.590
While he commented on the reservations about
the risks to macroeconomic stability, Primates

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:43.049
also re emphasised that the bank is not going
to ignore the crypto market ecosystem.

00:01:43.049 --> 00:01:47.880
His statements come against the backdrop of
the National Bank’s ongoing central bank

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.790
digital currency (CBDC) project.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.380
The National Bank of Kazakhstan had earlier
said it plans to present the results of the

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.950
CBDC study to stakeholders in July 2022.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:06.119
According to sources, the bank plans to announce
its methodology on a digital tenge by June

00:02:06.119 --> 00:02:07.119
end.

00:02:07.119 --> 00:02:11.720
The final decision on implementing the central
bank digital currency will reportedly be made

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:16.140
in accordance with that methodology before
the end of 2022.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:21.230
In May this year, the Kazakhstan parliament
made amendments to the national tax code which

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:26.380
suggested connecting a crypto mining tax tied
to the electricity prices consumed by mining

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.520
entities.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:33.690
Kazakhstan is one of the largest mining markets
in the world and generated approximately $1.5

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:40.239
million of state earnings from mining in Q1
2022.

00:02:40.239 --> 00:02:47.190
Next up, The value of the stablecoins, USDT
and USDC, falls by a significant amount.Earlier

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:55.070
in May, UST lost its peg twice, and its value
dropped by 56% in 24 hours.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:59.889
It raised questions in the market about the
stability that these stablecoins actually

00:02:59.889 --> 00:03:00.889
have.

00:03:00.889 --> 00:03:06.720
It was followed by Luna’s downfall when
the currency lost almost 99% of its value.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.459
Stablecoins Loses Peg Yet Again

00:03:08.459 --> 00:03:15.180
On June 6, a similar event occurred on the
Oasis Network when USDT and USDC de-pegged,

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:19.340
and their value fell to $0.12.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:27.739
The price of USDT could only bounce back to
$0.51, but USDC’s price went up to $0.98.

00:03:27.739 --> 00:03:33.700
This downfall has caused tension among the
users, and a few have questioned the suspicious

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:38.380
fall in the value of the stablecoins only
in the Oasis network.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:43.790
The Oasis is a blockchain platform that is
privacy-enabled for open finance.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:49.280
According to the data collected from DeFi
Llama, the TVL of the Oasis network plummeted

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:54.470
from $214.25m to $67.41m.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.459
The downfall began on June 4.

00:03:56.459 --> 00:04:00.459
Many are guessing that the lack of liquidity
could be the cause of the crash.

00:04:00.459 --> 00:04:07.100
In the last 24 hours, the value of the protocol
has gone down by 45.67%.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:12.859
And now moving onto our next update, Multiple
blockchain utilization instances are being

00:04:12.859 --> 00:04:17.609
incorporated in the banking industry right
now, varying from customer-facing payment

00:04:17.609 --> 00:04:20.790
technology to trading and exchange services.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:27.730
While the insurance sector lags behind banking
in terms of technology adoption, it is distinctively

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.900
placed to profit from blockchain technology.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.010
Prudential Insurance is all set to Plan a
Crypto Push

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:37.940
Prudential Financial, the American Fortune
Global 500 and Fortune 500 subsidiary companies

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:42.880
that offer insurance, planning for retirement,
investment management, and other services,

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:49.270
has lodged ten trademark applications to enter
the metaverse and the realm of non-fungible

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.410
tokens (NFTs).

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:56.590
The insurer filed ten trademark applications
with the United States Patent and Trademark

00:04:56.590 --> 00:05:03.050
Office relating to NFTs, cryptocurrencies,
and blockchain technology (USPTO).

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:08.960
Prudential’s iconic “The Rock,” asset
management subsidiary PGIM, its ticker “PRU,”

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.540
and the Rock logo have all registered trademark
applications.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:17.760
Prudential has been experimenting with blockchain
technology for a long time.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:23.090
The trademark applications for NFTs, cryptocurrencies,
and the metaverse, on the other hand, demonstrate

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.970
the company’s interest in cutting-edge technologies.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:32.030
As crypto adoption grows, the company’s
standpoint on digital assets has shifted.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:37.580
Michael Kondoudis, a trademark attorney, announced
the news on Twitter earlier today.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:41.270
Prudential Insurance will also offer virtual
insurance and financial services for the metaverse

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.460
and virtual worlds.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:49.790
The hype surrounding the metaverse has attracted
a slew of businesses, celebrities, and investors.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.530
According to the filling, Prudential will
be covering:

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:58.420
* Financial transaction services involving
cryptocurrency, NFTS +blockchain technology.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:03.860
* Virtual insurance and financial services
for the metaverse + virtual environments.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:11.980
* Providing financial information about decentralized
finance, NFTS + digital, virtual, and Cryptocurrencies.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:17.010
Many existing insurance companies face competitive
challenges, such as poor customer involvement,

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:23.420
slow growth in established markets, and digitization
trends, which blockchain can resolve.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:29.890
By automating critical functions, the most
encouraging insurance-related use cases can

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:35.240
be, enabling growth, increasing effectiveness,
and lowering costs.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.950
And now winding up with one last coverage
for today,The United Kingdom is expected to

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:44.889
begin live testing blockchain technology for
conventional marketing operations such as

00:06:44.889 --> 00:06:50.480
stock and bond trading and settlement as part
of an attempt to become a global “crypto

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.480
hub.”

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:52.930
UK to Test Blockchain Technology in Traditional
Market Activities.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:58.260
Utilizing distributed ledger technology (DLT),
which facilitates crypto assets, is a major

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:04.890
objective for making finance market infrastructure
more inventive and effective for users, as

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:08.790
per Gwyneth Nurse, the ministry’s director-general
for financial services.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:15.800
Nurse says the UK plans to develop a “sandbox”
for testing DLT projects within its financial

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.720
sector infrastructure next year.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:22.139
“The government might also want to see if
trading and settlement can be combined.”

00:07:22.139 --> 00:07:28.889
A sandbox will enable market participants
to try out new regulatory best practices and

00:07:28.889 --> 00:07:35.470
make structural changes, Nurse said at the
annual IDX derivatives conference in London.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:41.340
This is a framework that the UK government
spearheaded in terms of developing fintech

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.340
companies.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:47.250
A sandbox, for example, is a testing environment
for projects that involve real clients.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:51.970
Nurse stated that the finance ministry and
the Bank of England will collectively analyze

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:55.710
a digital pound later this year, following
a second consultation process.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:08:01.750
A digital pound would not be accessible until
the second half of the next decade, according

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:29.419
to Nurse, if a central bank digital currency
is authorized.

